Package: koinos-bsp-sg2042
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, linux-image-riscv64, koinos-hwcaps
Recommends: koinos-bsp-sg2042-firmware
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V BSP for Sophgo SG2042 (Milk-V Pioneer)
 This package provides Board Support Package for Sophgo SG2042 SoC
 used in Milk-V Pioneer and other workstation/server boards.
 .
 Includes:
  * Kernel modules for SG2042 peripherals (64x C920 cores)
  * Device Tree overlays for Milk-V Pioneer
  * DDR4 DIMM slot configuration
  * PCIe Gen 4 configuration (x8, x4)
  * 10GbE network configuration
  * ACPI tables for BRS server compliance
  * DDR4 ECC memory support
  * Thermal zone configuration
 .
 This is a server/workstation class SoC with full UEFI/ACPI support.

Package: koinos-bsp-sg2042-firmware
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, koinos-bsp-sg2042
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V BSP for SG2042 - Firmware blobs
 This package provides firmware blobs for SG2042 peripherals
 including DDR4 PHY, PCIe, and 10GbE firmware.
 .
 Note: Some firmware may require separate download due to licensing.
